{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00296",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 3.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Hi there, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.6,
      "end_seconds": 8.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Thanks, doctor. It's been a long few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.7,
      "end_seconds": 14.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Tell me from the beginning, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.71,
      "end_seconds": 22.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Mainly wheezing. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.46,
      "end_seconds": 27.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.93,
      "end_seconds": 30.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Probably one week. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.85,
      "end_seconds": 36.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.75,
      "end_seconds": 54.35,
      "duration_seconds": 16.6,
      "text": "It happens on and off. Cold air definitely sets it off. A six out of ten, um, I suppose. There's a tight chest as well. Oh, with tight chest, I notice it more with exercise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.77,
      "end_seconds": 61.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Is there anything medical in your background? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.06,
      "end_seconds": 67.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I've had asthma for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.21,
      "end_seconds": 74.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.54,
      "end_seconds": 88.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.06,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back. I'm a self-employed electrician. Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables. I share a flat with two friends."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.2,
      "end_seconds": 92.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.1,
      "end_seconds": 95.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.41,
      "end_seconds": 107.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Which tablets or creams or inhalers do you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.53,
      "end_seconds": 116.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "It's Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.19,
      "end_seconds": 120.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "And what about leg swelling or runny nose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.81,
      "end_seconds": 124.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No. None of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.34,
      "end_seconds": 129.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss or coughing up phlegm?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.54,
      "end_seconds": 135.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "No, no weight loss or coughing up phlegm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.14,
      "end_seconds": 140.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Right, anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.47,
      "end_seconds": 147.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.01,
      "end_seconds": 151.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.82,
      "end_seconds": 156.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.1,
      "end_seconds": 168.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.72,
      "end_seconds": 182.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.05,
      "end_seconds": 207.53,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "Okay: height 185 centimetres, weight 61 kilos, temperature is 37.0 degrees, pulse is 84 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 91 percent, respiratory rate 21, blood pressure 129 over 90."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.92,
      "end_seconds": 212.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Right, let me check a few things physically."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.35,
      "end_seconds": 216.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.9,
      "end_seconds": 238.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "I can hear a widespread wheeze on both sides when you breathe out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.82,
      "end_seconds": 244.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Right, you can sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.75,
      "end_seconds": 265.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, this looks most like an asthma flare-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.62,
      "end_seconds": 268.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.91,
      "end_seconds": 278.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an asthma flare-up is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.19,
      "end_seconds": 305.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.95,
      "text": "I'll request a peak flow reading, it'll help with asthma control. The treatment will be prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. That's for asthma flare-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.56,
      "end_seconds": 313.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "That's easy enough to remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.54,
      "end_seconds": 323.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Rinse your mouth after the steroid inhaler. Please come and see me in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.06,
      "end_seconds": 327.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Alright, I'll put it in my diary."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.15,
      "end_seconds": 330.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.76,
      "end_seconds": 334.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "All good here. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.07,
      "end_seconds": 336.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}